  subtitleList:
  - Now, to make that system work properly, we first need to calibrate your brain
    signals.
  - "We\u2019ll do that with a short training flight."
  - First, a few quick math tasks to see how your brain handles action.
  - "Then you\u2019ll close your eyes and drift\u2014so we can read your calm baseline."
  - "Once we\u2019re dialed in, you\u2019ll be cleared to fire."
  - "Ready? Let\u2019s get you tuned up."
